              "function_response": null,
              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "To log in to your **PreLicenseTraining.com (PLT)** account, select the option below that matches your account type:\n\n### 1. Student / Account Login\nIf you are taking pre-license training or continuing education (CE) courses:\n* **[PreLicenseTraining Student Login](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/login)**\n* *Note:* You will need your registered email address and password to log in. \n\n### 2. Mentor & Recruiter Login\nIf you are an agency manager, coach, or recruiter tracking student progress:\n* **[PreLicenseTraining Mentor Login](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/mentor/login)**\n\n---\n\n### Need Help Accessing Your Account?\n* **Forgot your password?** You can request a reset link on the **[Forgot Password Page](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/forgot-password)** by entering your registered email address.\n* **Forgot your username/login?** If you cannot remember your login name (which is typically your email address), you can recover it on the **[Forgot Login Page](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/forgot-login)** by entering your first and last name alongside your password.\n\n### Contact PreLicenseTraining Support\nIf you are locked out of your account, need administrative approval to access your student data, or have other technical difficulties, you can reach out to customer service:\n* **Phone:** 1 (800) 780-2113\n* **General Site:** **[PreLicenseTraining.com](https://www.prelicensetraining.com)**",
